e game data takes time: 5-10 minutes on first launch or with many mods. Please wait and keep the window open. Fullscreen, background, logs? F11 fullscreen; View → Run in background keeps the game running when unfocused; F10 shows the run log (useful when reporting errors). You're up to date (v{0})
